{"parent": {"page_id": "409730ce-e68d-81f1-9259-d14bea45ea61", "type": "page_id"}, "pages": [{"properties": {"title": "MobiHet Core \u2014 50 round"}, "content": "VeReMi NextGen v4: **5.343 xe**, train 37.361.273 d\u00f2ng, test 9.347.679 d\u00f2ng; 77 \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0o, 16 l\u1edbp.\n\nDAGSNet W=1; seed 42. \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 tr\u00ean test ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh xe (client own-test). C\u00e1c s\u1ed1 d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y t\u00ednh l\u1ea1i t\u1eeb confusion matrix \u0111\u00e3 pull, kh\u00f4ng ch\u00e9p t\u1eeb W&B.\n\nB\u1ea3n d\u1ef1ng theo protocol chung; kernel `mh-f2-core-s42-r50`; view headline **client** (own-test).\n\n## T\u00f3m t\u1eaft c\u00e1ch th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n\n\nMobiHet Core l\u00e0 ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac Federated Learning cho IDS V2X v\u1edbi low communication budget v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 model heterogeneity:\n- **M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh t\u1ea1i xe**: M\u1ed7i xe ch\u1ec9 duy tr\u00ec m\u1ed9t m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Private duy nh\u1ea5t, kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng m\u00f4 h\u00ecnh Proxy chia s\u1ebb.\n- **Giao ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac**: Kh\u00f4ng trao \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ecdng s\u1ed1 hay gradient. M\u1ed7i round xe ch\u1ec9 g\u1eedi ma tr\u1eadn ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i x\u00e1c su\u1ea5t l\u1edbp $16 \\times 16$ ($V_k$) v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn v\u1ec1 ma tr\u1eadn soft teacher to\u00e0n m\u1ea1ng $Q \\in \\mathbb{R}^{16 \\times 16}$ \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng fp16 (544 bytes m\u1ed7i chi\u1ec1u, t\u1ed5ng 1.088 B/round/xe).\n- **M\u00f4 h\u00ecnh sinh Gaussian copula n\u00e9n**: \u01af\u1edbc l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ph\u00e2n b\u1ed1 bi\u00ean th\u1ef1c nghi\u1ec7m 256 bin (l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1eed h\u00f3a uint16) v\u00e0 ma tr\u1eadn t\u01b0\u01a1ng quan normal-score (fp16) m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n l\u00fac bootstrap \u0111\u1ec3 sinh d\u1eef li\u1ec7u nh\u00e2n t\u1ea1o b\u00f9 \u0111\u1eafp c\u00e1c l\u1edbp t\u1ea5n c\u00f4ng v\u1eafng do non-IID.\n- **Hu\u1ea5n luy\u1ec7n c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9**: K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0m m\u1ea5t m\u00e1t cross-entropy v\u1edbi Logit Adjustment ($\\tau = 1.0$) tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1eadt v\u00e0 m\u1ea5t m\u00e1t ch\u01b0ng c\u1ea5t Kullback-Leibler divergence theo ph\u00e2n b\u1ed1 $Q$ tr\u00ean 64 m\u1eabu nh\u00e2n t\u1ea1o m\u1ed7i b\u01b0\u1edbc.\n- **C\u01a1 ch\u1ebf step floor**: V\u1edbi c\u00e1c xe \u00edt d\u1eef li\u1ec7u (<16 b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1eadt m\u1ed9t epoch), xe t\u1ef1 sinh th\u00eam c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u1ec9 tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u nh\u00e2n t\u1ea1o cho \u0111\u1ee7 ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng 16 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n c\u00e1c l\u1edbp v\u1eafng.\n\n## C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh\n\n```json\n{\n  \"method\": \"mobihet_core\",\n  \"cfg\": {\n    \"patch_len\": 7,\n    \"stem_ch\": 96,\n    \"dense_growth\": 32,\n    \"dense_layers\": 3,\n    \"incep_ch\": 32,\n    \"incep_modules\": 2,\n    \"alex_ch\": 128,\n    \"fire_sq\": 32,\n    \"fire_ex\": 48,\n    \"fire_modules\": 3,\n    \"head_hidden\": 256,\n    \"dropout\": 0.1,\n    \"n_features\": 77,\n    \"num_classes\": 16\n  },\n  \"hp\": {\n    \"rounds\": 50,\n    \"batch\": 64,\n    \"lr_max\": 0.001,\n    \"lr_min\": 1e-05,\n    \"weight_decay\": 0.0001,\n    \"clip\": 1.0,\n    \"seed\": 42,\n    \"group_rows\": 4096,\n    \"amp\": true,\n    \"arm\": \"none\",\n    \"synth\": \"copula\",\n    \"synth_rows\": 64,\n    \"q_codec\": \"mean_fp16\",\n    \"synth_step_floor\": 16,\n    \"w_boot\": \"compact\"\n  },\n  \"n_params\": 395408,\n  \"clients\": 5343,\n  \"payload_bytes\": {\n    \"bootstrap_up\": 271031,\n    \"bootstrap_down\": 729408,\n    \"round_up\": 544,\n    \"round_down\": 544,\n    \"total_50_rounds\": 1054839\n  },\n  \"backend\": \"compiled\"\n}\n```\n\naccuracy = precision_micro = recall_micro = recall_weighted = f1_micro trong b\u00e0i to\u00e1n single-label n\u00e0y; v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u1ee7 10 c\u1ed9t.\n\n## \u0110i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i r50 \u2014 \u0111\u1ee7 10 metric\n\n| View | accuracy | precision_macro |